  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Desolation\" title=\"Gate of Desolation\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Desolation_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Gate of Desolation (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Gate of Desolation\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Desolation.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Desolation.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/66/Gate_of_Desolation.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Desolation.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/6/66/Gate_of_Desolation.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation\" title=\"The Desolation\">The Desolation</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sulfurous_Wastes\" title=\"The Sulfurous Wastes\">The Sulfurous Wastes</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Turai%27s_Procession\" title=\"Turai&#39;s Procession\">Turai's Procession</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Desolation world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/1a/Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"165\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1a/Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg/294px-Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1a/Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg/392px-Gate_of_Desolation_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"654\" data-file-height=\"549\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Desolation inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/3b/Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3b/Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg/294px-Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3b/Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg/392px-Gate_of_Desolation_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>Once a mighty edifice designed to repel desert raiders like <a href=\"/wiki/Palawa_Joko\" title=\"Palawa Joko\">Palawa Joko</a>, the Gates <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"Plural\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> of Desolation are a broken skeleton slowly being reclaimed by the desert. A few determined traders hang on, although their customers are mostly <a href=\"/wiki/Centaur\" title=\"Centaur\">Centaurs</a> from the plains.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gate of Desolation</a> is the <a href=\"/wiki/Outpost\" title=\"Outpost\">outpost</a> that connects <a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation\" title=\"The Desolation\">the Desolation</a>. It is the last bastion of civilization against the sulfurous wasteland.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Crossing_the_Desolation\" title=\"Crossing the Desolation\">Crossing the Desolation</a> leads here for the next <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall_campaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall campaign\">Nightfall campaign</a>. This <a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">mission outpost</a> is located on the northwestern end of <a href=\"/wiki/Turai%27s_Procession\" title=\"Turai&#39;s Procession\">Turai's Procession</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sulfurous_Wastes\" title=\"The Sulfurous Wastes\">The Sulfurous Wastes</a> (northwest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Turai%27s_Procession\" title=\"Turai&#39;s Procession\">Turai's Procession</a> (southeast)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Wandering_Scribe\" title=\"Wandering Scribe\">Wandering Scribes</a> (3 <a href=\"/wiki/Collector\" title=\"Collector\">collectors</a> for 1, 3, and 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Artifact\" title=\"Ancient Artifact\">Ancient Artifacts</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Sahnbur\" title=\"Sahnbur\">Sahnbur</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Laph_Longmane\" title=\"Laph Longmane\">Laph Longmane</a> (mission access)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Nermak\" title=\"Nermak\">Nermak</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Pilgrim\" title=\"Ascension Pilgrim\">Ascension Pilgrim</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Dynastic_Spirit\" title=\"Dynastic Spirit\">Dynastic Spirit</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Desolation\" title=\"Gate of Desolation\">Gate of Desolation mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/Crossing_the_Desolation\" title=\"Crossing the Desolation\">Crossing the Desolation</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Desolation_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The map that comes with the Guild Wars Nightfall: Collector's Edition box calls this outpost Gates of Desolation, making the definition grammatically incorrect. Additionally, this outpost was called Gates of Desolation in-game until an update rectified it to its current name.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"The Desolation\">Towns and outposts in the Desolation</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Palace\" title=\"Bone Palace\">Bone Palace</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gate of Desolation</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lair_of_the_Forgotten\" title=\"Lair of the Forgotten\">Lair of the Forgotten</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remains_of_Sahlahja_(outpost)\" title=\"Remains of Sahlahja (outpost)\">Remains of Sahlahja</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Morah_(outpost)\" title=\"Ruins of Morah (outpost)\">Ruins of Morah</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mouth_of_Torment\" title=\"The Mouth of Torment\">The Mouth of Torment</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation#Missions\" title=\"The Desolation\">Missions</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation#Explorable_areas\" title=\"The Desolation\">Explorable areas</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/The_Desolation#Landmarks\" title=\"The Desolation\">Landmarks</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009131040\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 916/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8114/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1461/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.248      1 -total\n 40.54%   32.532      1 Template:Location_disambiguation_2\n 19.19%   15.399      8 Template:Ifexists\n 18.87%   15.145      1 Template:Location_infobox\n  6.74%    5.409      1 Template:Quotation\n  5.66%    4.538      1 Template:W\n  4.08%    3.275      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  3.84%    3.084      8 Template:Profession_icon_sizes\n  3.19%    2.557      1 Template:Towns